<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-suzukii-turing-wavelength-s0-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Drosophila suzukii Turing onset wavelength at 2.046 µm (0 Ma, detail scale) — MorphoEval overall 81.2/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Pass 1. Schnakenberg kinetics with the Turing onset wavenumber calibrated so lambda_c = 2.046 µm at age 0 Ma. A pure-u mode kick gave dispersion Pearson r = 0.970, under the 0.98 gate. The noise-seeded field is a labyrinth (spacing CV 0.37). Subobscura (f_u < 0) and equal diffusion stay flat, but the first figure autoscaled that roundoff into fake stripes. Specimen Otsu metrics are real and not equal to their priors. The McEvey plate does not resolve 2.046 µm. Overall 81.2/100 (faithfulness 78.9, reproducibility 86.8); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 0c76d15d; environment: . Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 84, Morphological realism / specimen match 74, Parameter expressivity 82, Morphometric validation 78, Source and data traceability 90, Code-to-model traceability 84, Reproducibility package 86. Output judged: docs/media/drosophila_suzukii_turing_wavelength_s0_comparison.png: rendered output of models/2026-delphi10000-drosophila-suzukii-turing-wavelength-s0.py at 0c76d15d, image/png, 562769 B, 1584×984 px, artifact_sha256 e240d3ff629f62b8628ad36760770d1c8f961a5e7ca4c4daa4fa8196d85b386a (sha256 e240d3ff629f62b8628ad36760770d1c8f961a5e7ca4c4daa4fa8196d85b386a), spec_fingerprint 8f4a40558dfdd1a363ec347c2232dbab086e21c6d2b0baf5b5a36feb603bb029. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 8f4a40558dfdd1a363ec347c2232dbab086e21c6d2b0baf5b5a36feb603bb029; artifact_sha256: e240d3ff629f62b8628ad36760770d1c8f961a5e7ca4c4daa4fa8196d85b386a; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/drosophila_suzukii_turing_wavelength_s0/drosophila_suzukii_specimen.jpg=a4180479fce43c90..., datasets/drosophila_suzukii_turing_wavelength_s0/drosophila_suzukii_turing_wavelength_s0_reference.json=6dcb8c0b6f42ebaf...}. Claim boundary: reported_in_source: Male D. suzukii has an apical wing spot; the female has a serrated ovipositor (Atallah 2014). | Spot presence in the suzukii–biarmipes clade is a yellow cis-regulatory gain (Gompel 2005; Prud'homme 2006; Koshikawa 2020). | A two-species reaction-diffusion system selects a finite onset wavenumber k_c (Turing 1952).; reconstructed_in_script: Schnakenberg a=0.037, b=1.284, D_v/D_u=12.6, with D_u solved so lambda_c = 2.046 µm. | Subobscura is the same diffusivities with a=0.52, b=0.18 so f_u = -17/35. | Takahashii is the same kinetics with diffusivities multiplied by 1.44, so lambda_c = 2.4552 µm.; transfer_boundary: The 2.046 µm value is the campaign detail-scale assignment, not a published granule measurement. | The McEvey plate anchors the animal and the wing-spot dimorphism. Its pixels are coarser than 2 µm.; does_not_claim: That yellow or ebony enzyme kinetics are the Schnakenberg reactions. | That D. takahashii has been measured at a 2.455 µm pigment wavelength. | That subobscura, suzukii and takahashii form a stratigraphic ancestor chain. All three are extant (0 Ma).." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Add the diffusivity sweep, the equal-diffusion ablation, and the subobscura f_u < 0 control to the self-test assertions, not only to the notebook narrative.",
        "remediation needed: Draw the null controls on the focal color scale. Autoscaling 1e-15 roundoff drew fake stripes on subobscura.",
        "remediation needed: Replace the pure-u mode kick with least-stable-eigenvector initial data so analytical and numerical sigma(k) clear Pearson r > 0.98.",
        "remediation needed: Seed a critical-mode stripe and report its spacing against lambda_c. The noise-seeded labyrinth CV is 0.37.",
        "remediation needed: Segment the McEvey plate (Otsu foreground, melanin fraction, abdominal troughs, structure-tensor coherency) and keep every specimen value different from its reference.",
        "remediation needed: Single assessor only. The plate cannot resolve 2.046 µm; do not treat organism-level Otsu numbers as a carrier measurement." ;
    pk:hasScore 8.12e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-suzukii-turing-wavelength-s0-parameter-expressivity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
